106:      "criterion": "`callisto --help` lists eight commands (add, status, version, pre, snapshot, init, release, completions), each with a one-line description, plus the global options --format, --cwd, --dry-run, --help and --version."
118:      "criterion": "`--format`, `--cwd` and `--dry-run` are accepted before or after any subcommand name; --format defaults to text and --cwd defaults to the current directory."
